            "review_title": "Review at Noc Noc Cocktails And Tea",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nNot bad\nMar 2023 • Friends\nTook some searching but I finally found it. Down alley 2 Phan Boi Chau.\n\nMenu is a bit hard to read given the lighting but they appear to have put thought into their signature cocktails.\n\nPricing is appropriate for the country as well. 150k for a signature inspires some confidence in the craft.\n\nMusic sounds quintessentially vinahouse.\n\nOne point of contention is the lack of attentiveness at the end of my beverage. Finished the drink and placed the glass in a prominent location. Nobody checked. Nobody asked. So I got the bill and left.\n\nWould I come back? Possibly. There’s a plethora of a lot of other options to consider first.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 3, 2023",
